From 8c6abef07ed5f12e969c93fff683b68a209c5b40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mateus Seiboth <mateusseiboth@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:37:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sc7280: add Xiaomi 11 Lite 5G NE
 support

Add the upstream sm7325-xiaomi-lisa DTS and the changes the stock Xiaomi
ABL (HyperOS 2) needs to boot it: msm-id and board-id, the splash_region
reserved memory node, the mem-offline and Android fstab nodes, and the
__symbols__ the Gunyah hypervisor overlay resolves (wdog, arch_timer, soc).

Enable the display (CSOT VTDR6130 panel driver from the mainlining fork,
ported to devm_drm_panel_alloc, restoring the backlight after its init
sequence), the speaker and earpiece (two TFA9873 on PRIMARY_MI2S), the
macro camera (S5K5E9 driver from the mainlining fork) and the ultra-wide
camera (IMX355), and enable simpledrm for the early framebuffer.

Make qcom_battmgr stop polling battery properties that Xiaomi's firmware
numbers differently: each poll used to wait one second for nothing.
